/**
 * onAddObject
 *
 * Override default add_object() processing.
 * Return a string objectId, or current::useDefaultProcessing to use
 * mappedAdapterId (requires mappedAdapterId on the model adapter conf).
 *
 * Notable current:: variables: adapterId, objectType, object, objectId,
 * mappedAdapterId (if configured), useDefaultProcessing.
 */

/* Example: fully handle add in script (no mapped backend required). */
/*
return current::objectId ?? generate_uuid();
*/

/* Example: fall through to default map-and-forward (needs mappedAdapterId). */
return current::useDefaultProcessing;
